      <Placemark>
        <name>志茂の水天宮</name>
        <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/umsh/AN6v0v5oi3Rl02j_QerFFRzixdS6uMzDDGOqCGoudZpOYTwJxB2Ee67gZxov_Z2KkcXqpuCQsbWhQy23NpDjGfib5ymMOpzB5iydnXv2Ji7tit5Ga1Li_25Bg5mq51zvH77IebIe0CIlXteukzYSayzxA-h2VV75PEZKXPTciL8iQX-0jgBgkH0ZB2DplSWlHjwtLaQ2IumM6iPDP6inCdheWG9c91VxPeDuuDuJ1l6nM_HkeU4VAOera4oFpcSX4XI00gmYJyoLfZxp3iCnNJmm7YXB-EO2Caaz0PGUFPYp-zBVwL1dcm5WskwP6fEQQU0O9jE2PtR5qyKk5N-Cz3IY4nqGSoUi2e4g-87LbTDlfhekprj8iYP7eKqq-B_GY1blsbBcGSMGYAq4w5l40FpSU_mSYdSBKQu6Ohbx-4YSrc8caglQwPjbAL143i0uBE0YgSGW8RzWakoJ0NuL6JM3SrfXerTB04B1Y4oTDMWzG5C1w8mi3zEZ32JgxNwxkqm1ZEPffTDBnn-WevHPQQWaEv0-99MOYg2UPuu1f6G9DeIYX1GVgheg0oyP7TUqakXcJfHAF-bDvv_vA02t0UJlG4c2qGD_Aq-ItwEhuqOWDGOv-8UH8ade9HECkdg20zUqCD0VgPS6SyoDPce7c5EJJIawO_riHWWLfAmEej93Lmd3J07nywn4zIg-SbFmWVcMUF8ZnnupKdGVl5pQg7uyhohuXAnoZQ" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>志茂(しも)の水神宮は、大場家に祀る屋敷神です。江戸時代に本家にょり分霊したと言われています。<br><br><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/umsh/AN6v0v6Vkf2wLqyxhHfFLAsTaV1waT701uVS3NKl3Pu87VI7-4XCn6U1LHvCfvcnK8ZNpZ_2THjAyZqnN85_NVFJPnVwKhptJe119mdA3YcYfrxyDLzR7iLUvA0Z6ALh2lyLl0h2DD_zBTZ974vRk_rGGQlAgq1jCRo5qYC3VAOgFi59EoWo27CQ_NcH88hl5xtYD6s7NZO3MYYoTOY90vqPYDktIQNv3D7F5BHbvWeJiwOHuBbcn0NJgLISI7SS2OuSxOj8qfFEH8V-qPqCcenCmpLn5hekBXPvLsg3r3BR-SCDX6J99oXuXH0FTrQcmLQOGXrjy_G-DVhOgE1WUF57a4RDoAVkiRfK4phrzyRXy40GA17vIu9PHFvahLe6cUvns4hfC__va5wFVkn1ceJZp59pGvcKph-th3NVx8IKI7zHB-6W7XjNsup_kfwviYYAaO20Bty-n-hYSqysnWRQH4TQjzXHu7lVSh2llwermiDitt3n_PQ33RgZJFVR_loe2ry7AIu3zkNWwk74uuLJmZ9DbD1TvpceAeN05RM1sCrlSGmYQuMJ2DArxxcPc9H97M6Y4FzK_l-r3q00XLV0e0LSuNjOmAM-rxzivfKuhQWcAi6xrZ3ef6FbkKR_CsueeoYi4-XMo7mBwYpjDwM7l8NgUom_KB4qCshrI8VTgBsolDirGu0eJQfr5829maibhmmz7lGx0QtOWrVH6S7IJWKQPAgpeg" height="200" width="auto" />]]></description>
        <styleUrl>#icon-1677-C2185B</styleUrl>
